{"id":131514347,"slug":"dear-psychedelic-exceptionalism","title":"Dear Psychedelic Exceptionalism...🛑🙏✋ ","subtitle":"Come on...really...stop it.","post_date":"2023-06-30T14:47:52.256Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/dear-psychedelic-exceptionalism","wordcount":448,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:58:37.761Z","body_sha256":"616c66fc7c446a39ef74173c5a52ec43c5a30ff26559397f23aec3e92b1cf81e","text_words":479,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p><em><strong>The Frontier Psychiatrists</strong> is a newsletter written by Owen Scott Muir, M.D.  He is a child and adult Psychiatrist, Health Technology nerd, satirist, and advocate for human decency and curiosity. It is worth noting that some of the things I write are intended as satire, and some are very serious.  This intro is marking my intentions!   Today’s article, as previewed, is another example of “whimsy being used to make a serious point.”</em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share\"><span>Share The Frontier Psychiatrists </span></a></p><div><hr></div><p>Psychedelics…might be remarkable experiences. </p><p>But, for a minute, that is true of things that are not medical care.</p><p>Here is a glib meme from Twitter today:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iqdf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87dd0b50-b84a-478d-9f4e-212aa2b2f2f0_974x865.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iqdf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87dd0b50-b84a-478d-9f4e-212aa2b2f2f0_974x865.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iqdf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87dd0b50-b84a-478d-9f4e-212aa2b2f2f0_974x865.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iqdf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87dd0b50-b84a-478d-9f4e-212aa2b2f2f0_974x865.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iqdf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87dd0b50-b84a-478d-9f4e-212aa2b2f2f0_974x865.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iqdf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87dd0b50-b84a-478d-9f4e-212aa2b2f2f0_974x865.jpeg\" width=\"974\" height=\"865\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/87dd0b50-b84a-478d-9f4e-212aa2b2f2f0_974x865.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:865,&quot;width&quot;:974,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:271495,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Twitter Meme Owen Muir is Sharing of a Trojan horse&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot